Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Reading user input", "Subsection"],
Cell["Input fields keep what the user typed inside Hold. Before evaluating it, every symbol called t (or z, x, y) is replaced by a formal symbol, whatever context it was typed in. This is what makes typed expressions such as Cos[t] work reliably.", "Text"],
