Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Interface", "Subsection"],
Cell["Each piece of the interface is built by a function that receives the tool's state variables wrapped in Dynamic, so the controls it creates can change them. Expensive work happens in a single asynchronous Dynamic (in ConformalMapTool, below) that recomputes the results whenever the configuration or the settings change; the plots only redraw from those results.", "Text"],
